LOG MAINTENANCE STANDARD
------------------------
For each future incident, record:

  - Date and environment
  - Affected component and severity
  - Sanitized error output
  - User-visible and platform impact
  - Confirmed root cause
  - Corrective action
  - Validation evidence
  - Preventive control or follow-up owner

Append new entries; do not rewrite historical root causes without documenting why.
